# UI Design System

Before changing HTML, CSS, or templates, read `design-system/AGENTS.md`.

- One stylesheet: `app/static/style.css`. Theme: `app/static/theme.js`.
- Use existing classes and tokens (`design-system/components.md`, `design-system/tokens.md`).
- Compact shell: topbar + `.view`. No CRM sidebar.
- Job status pills: queued `pill--info`, running `pill--warn`, done `pill--ok`, failed `pill--bad`.

Do not hardcode colors or revive old classes (`.badge`, `.button`, `.shell`).
